      "id": "7446a16247a8f04b1fa476e526cdaa97be00f32e",
      "short_id": "7446a162",
      "created_at": "2021-03-10T22:06:58.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "933e7f5eb6798e72e349099be3cd16a890be7fc7"
      ],
      "title": "pcapng: get rid of the local pcapng_t in pcapng_open().",
      "message": "pcapng: get rid of the local pcapng_t in pcapng_open().\n\nPass a null pointer to pcapng_read_block(), instead.  In\npcapng_read_block(), treat that as the indication that we're trying to\nread the purported first SHB, rather than treating a null section_info\npointer as that indication.\n\nThis addreses one, but not all, of the problems reported in issue #17281.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2021-03-10T12:55:50.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "Guy Harris",
      "committer_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "committed_date": "2021-03-10T22:06:58.000+00:00",
